# GitHub Linguist - what counts toward the repository language bar.
#
# Measured 2026-09-08. Two trees are excluded, for two different reasons:
#
#   firmware/t1-revc/components/   Third-party. Today this is one component,
#                                  Espressif's dns_server example (3 files,
#                                  12 KB, SPDX: Unlicense OR CC0-1.0). Small,
#                                  but it is not our code.
#   firmware/legacy/               Our own, but unmaintained: the original
#                                  Arduino LSM6DS3 variants that predate the
#                                  T1. Kept for reference, not representative
#                                  of the project. See firmware/legacy/README.md.
#
# Everything else stays counted on purpose. The shipping firmware
# (firmware/t1-revc/main) is C, the bit-locked DSP reference
# (firmware/shared) is TypeScript, and diy/ is live DIY material the README
# actively points people at - none of that should be hidden from the bar.

firmware/t1-revc/components/**  linguist-vendored
firmware/legacy/**              linguist-vendored
